change 91 dojo.goto 4.4 1 2.7
input 91 1
input 100 1 use
input 101 1
change 171 dojo.goto 3 1 3.5
input 171 1 move @0
change 261 dojo.goto 7 1.2 -4
input 261 1
input 461 1 move @14
input 490 1
change 501 dojo.goto 4.6 1 -4
end 720 d90aefba
